+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+### Command line
+
+Landscape commands:
+* `analyzeLandscape` - creates or updates a Sokrates landscape report (`_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and `index.html`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under `-analysisRoot`
+* `updateLandscape` - the previous name of `analyzeLandscape`; it behaves identically and is kept for existing scripts
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
